{"strongs": "H2428", "word": "חַ֫יִל", "translit": "cha.yil", "root": "חוט", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "strength, efficiency, wealth, army", "definition": "חַ֫יִל 244 noun masculine 2Kgs 10:2 strength, efficiency, wealth, army ; — absolute ׳ ח Gen 47:6 +, חָ֑יִל Ps 60:14 +, חָ֑יִל Ps 60:14 +, חֵיל Isa 36:2 ; 2Kgs 18:17 construct חֵיל Exod 14:28 + (on Ps 10:10 see חלכה ); suffix חֵילִי Job 31:25 + 2 t.; חֵילְךָ Jer 15:13 +; חֵילוֺ Exod 14:4 +, etc.; plural חֲיָלִים 1Chr 7:5 + 19 t.; suffix חֵילֵיהֶם Isa 30:6 — 1. strength , usually physical: \\ \\ a. seldom alone (chiefly in poetry) 1Sam 2:4 ; Ps 18:33 ; Ps 18:40 = 2Sam 22:33 ; 2Sam 22:40 also ׳ נָָּֽברוּ ח Job 21:7 , compare Eccl 10:10 מֵחַיִל אֶלחָֿ֑יִל Ps 84:8 ׳ בְּכֹחַ ח 2Chr 26:13 of virility Prov 31:3 of ׳ י 's power Ps 59:12 ; Ps 110:3 , compare Hab 3:19 strength of horse Ps 33:17 figurative of product of vine and fig-tree Joel 2:22 (|| פְּרִי ). \\ \\ b. of result or display of strength ׳ עשׂה ח achieve might = do valiantly Num 24:18 ( J E ), 1Sam 14:48 ; Ps 60:14 = Ps 108:14 ; Ps 118:15 ; Ps 118:16 . \\ \\ c. often in phrases ׳ גִּבּוֺר(הַ)ח , ׳ גִּבּוֺרֵי(הַ)ח hero(es) of strength, mighty man (men) of valour Josh 1:14 ( D ), Josh 6:2 ; Josh 8:3 ; Josh 10:7 (all J E ), Judg 6:12 ; Judg 11:1 ; 1Sam 9:1 ; 1Sam 16:18 ; 1Kgs 11:28 ; 2Kgs 5:1 ; 2Kgs 15:20 ; 2Kgs 24:14 ; 2Kgs 24:16 ; 1Chr 5:24 ; 1Chr 7:2 ; 1Chr 7:9 ; 1Chr 8:40 + (very frequently in Chronicles), note especially ׳ הַגִּבּוֺרִים וכל גבורי ח 1Chr 28:1 also ׳ ח ׳ ג 2Chr 13:3 (|| מלחמה ׳ ג ); (הַ)חֲיָלִים ׳ ג 1Chr 7:5 ; 1Chr 7:7 ; 1Chr 7:11 ; 1Chr 7:40 ; 1Chr 11:26 (see also גִּבּוֺר , p. 150); ׳ בֶּןֿ(הַ)ח , ׳ בְּנֵי(הַ)ח Deut 3:18 ; Judg 18:2 + (see בֵּן 8 , p. 121); ׳ אִישׁ ח , ׳ אַנְשֵׁי ח Judg 3:29 ; Judg 20:44 ; Judg 20:46 ; Judg 1:12 ; Judg 11:16 ; 2Sam 23:20 ( Qr ; Kt חי , on phrase בןאֿישׁ חיל compare Dr ) = 1Chr 11:22 ( Kt חיל ), 2Sam 24:9 ; Nah 2:4 ; Jer 48:15 ; 1Chr 10:12 ; Neh 11:6 ; Ps 76:6 ironical לִמְסֹךְ שֵׁכָר ׳ ח ׳ א Isa 5:22 = (|| גבורים לשׁתות יין ); Eccl 12:3 metaphor of legs. 2. ability, efficiency , often involving moral worth ׳ אַנְשֵׁי ח Gen 47:6 ( J ), Exod 18:21 ; Exod 18:25 (both E ); of a woman אֵשֶׁת ׳ ח Prov 12:4 ; Prov 31:10 ; Ruth 3:11 compare 1Kgs 1:42 ; 1Kgs 1:52 (opposed to רעה ), and especially יִרְאֵי אלהים אַנְשֵׁי אֱמֶת שׂנְאֵי בָּ֑צַע ׳ אַנְשֵׁי ח Exod 18:21 ( E ); עָשָׂה חיל Prov 31:29 do worthily, efficiently , perhaps also Ruth 4:11 late (with weakened meaning of גִּבּוֺר ) גִּבּוֺרֵי חֵיל מְלֶאכֶת עֲבוֺדַת בֵּית הָאלהים 1Chr 9:13 , compare בַּכִּחַ לַעֲבֹדָה ׳ אישׁ ח 1Chr 26:8 . So also 1Sam 10:26 (read ׳ בְּנֵי ח , see ᵐ5 We Dr , men of worth , opposed to בני בליעל v 1Sam 10:27 ) for ᵑ0 ׳ ח force, band . 3. wealth Gen 34:29 = Num 31:9 (both P ), Deut 8:17 ; Deut 8:18 ; Deut 33:11 ; Isa 8:4 ; Isa 10:14 ; Isa 30:6 (|| אוֺצְרֹתָם ), Isa 60:5 (|| הֲמוֺן יָם ) v Isa 60:11 ; Isa 61:6 ; Mic 4:13 ; Jer 15:13 ; Jer 17:3 (both || אצרות ), Zeph 1:13 ; Ezek 26:12 ; Ezek 28:4 ; Ezek 28:5 (twice in verse); Zech 14:14 ; Job 5:5 ; Job 15:29 ; Job 20:15 ; Job 20:18 ; Job 31:25 ; Ps 49:7 ; Ps 49:11 ; Ps 62:11 ; Ps 73:12 ; Prov 13:22 . 4. force, army , very often Exod 14:4 ; Exod 14:9 ; Exod 14:17 ; Exod 14:28 (all P ), Exod 15:4 (song), 1Sam 17:20 ; 2Sam 8:9 ; 2Kgs 6:4 ; 2Kgs 6:15 ; 2Kgs 25:1 ; 2Kgs 25:5 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 25:10 ; 2Chr 13:3 ( בְּחַיִל גִּבּוֺרֵי מלחמה ), 2Chr 14:7 ; 2Chr 16:7 ; 2Chr 23:14 +; so usually Jeremiah: Jer 32:2 ; Jer 34:1 +; frequently Ezekiel: Ezek 17:17 ; Ezek 27:10 +; Dan 11:7 ; Dan 11:13 ; Dan 11:25 (twice in verse); Dan 11:26 = a band 1Sam 10:26 ( ᵑ0 , but see 2 , adfin. ); of train of Queen of Sheba גדול ׳ ח 1Kgs 10:2 = 2Chr 9:1 חֵיל כָּבֵד Isa 36:1 = 2Kgs 18:17 a powerful army (on form compare Sta § 194 c ); also (late) חֵיל הַצָּבָא 1Chr 20:1 ; 2Chr 26:13 , חֵיל עָם Esth 8:11 הֲמוֺן חֲיָלִים Dan 11:10 ׳ שַׂרהֿח 2Sam 24:2 = captain of the host , ׳ שָׂרֵי הח v 2Sam 24:4 v 2Sam 24:4 שָׂרֵי הַחֲיָלִים captains of armies (bands, divisions) 1Kgs 15:20 = 2Chr 16:4 ; 2Kgs 25:23 ; Jer 40:7 ; Jer 40:13 ; Jer 41:11 ; Jer 41:13 ; Jer 41:16 ; Jer 42:1 ; Jer 42:8 ; Jer 43:4 ; Jer 43:5 . פִּקּוּדֵי החִיל Num 31:14 ( P ). — חֵילוּ Ezek 32:31 omitted by B Hi Co : for חֵילֵךְ Ezek 27:11 read probably a proper name, of a location, compare Da ; Co proposes חתלון (compare Ezek 47:15 ; Ezek 48:1 ), Hal MÈl. Epigr. 1874, 69 חלך = Cilicia , see Lag M i. 211 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2622')\">BDB2622</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2428')\">H2428</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2621')\">BDB2621</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2623')\">BDB2623</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חַ֫יִל</bdbheb><sub>244</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,2)\">2Kgs 10:2</ref></sup> <highlightword>strength, efficiency, wealth, army</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 47:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,6)\">Gen 47:6</ref> +, <bdbheb>חָ֑יִל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,14)\">Ps 60:14</ref> +, <bdbheb>חָ֑יִל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,14)\">Ps 60:14</ref> +, <bdbheb>חֵיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 36:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,2)\">Isa 36:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,17)\">2Kgs 18:17</ref> construct <bdbheb>חֵיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,28)\">Exod 14:28</ref> + (on <ref ref=\"Ps 10:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,10)\">Ps 10:10</r