 vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,42)\">1Kgs 1:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:52\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,52)\">1Kgs 1:52</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>רעה</bdbheb>), and especially <bdbheb>יִרְאֵי אלהים אַנְשֵׁי אֱמֶת שׂנְאֵי בָּ֑צַע</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַנְשֵׁי ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,21)\">Exod 18:21</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>עָשָׂה חיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 31:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,29)\">Prov 31:29</ref> <highlight>do worthily, efficiently</highlight>, perhaps also <ref ref=\"Ruth 4:11\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(8,4,11)\">Ruth 4:11</ref> late (with weakened meaning of <bdbheb>גִּבּוֺר</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>גִּבּוֺרֵי חֵיל מְלֶאכֶת עֲבוֺדַת בֵּית הָאלהים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,13)\">1Chr 9:13</ref>, compare <bdbheb>בַּכִּחַ לַעֲבֹדָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אישׁ ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,8)\">1Chr 26:8</ref>. So also <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:26\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,26)\">1Sam 10:26</ref> (read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּנֵי ח</bdbheb>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, <highlight>men of worth</highlight>, opposed to <bdbheb>בני בליעל</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Sam 10:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,27)\">1Sam 10:27</ref>) for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <b